OL,3,GNEWSAWhat will you tell your
OL,4,Agrandchildren about the summer of '26?
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor decades, 1976 has been the
OL,7,Fbenchmark for hot summers in the UK.
OL,9,FBut half a century later, has 2026 now
OL,10,Fclaimed that position?
OL,12,FIt has been a summer of broken records,
OL,13,Fwildfires and hosepipe bans across the
OL,14,FSouth.
OL,16,FAs it draws to a close, we look back on
OL,17,Fsome of the moments that will be talked
OL,18,Fabout for years to come.
